}

Stream a chat response from Claude AI.

This endpoint uses Server-Sent Events (SSE) to stream the response in real-time.
The stream includes:
- `text`: Text chunks as they're generated
- `tool_start`: When Claude starts using a tool
- `tool_call`: Tool execution with results
- `embed`: Rich embed data (market cards, charts)
- `action`: Trading action buttons
- `usage`: Token usage statistics
- `done`: Stream complete
- `error`: Error occurred

**Example client:**
```javascript
const eventSource = new EventSource('/api/v1/chat/stream');
eventSource.addEventListener('text', (e) => {
    const data = JSON.parse(e.data);
    appendToChat(data.content);
});
```
